om/watch?v=f2h69nCpxyo", "date": "2026-11-23T14:36:25Z"}]}, {"text": "Nvidia shares rose about 31% after the news. On Tuesday premarket they fell about 4% to 5%, and Micron dropped about 7%.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "MarketWatch", "url": "https://www.marketwatch.com/story/the-epic-buying-of-retail-investors-paid-off-after-nvidias-31-stock-surge-says-strategist-c8f9a502?mod=mw_rss_topstories", "date": "2026-11-24T11:39:00Z"}, {"name": "bloomingbit", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTFBMbTQyeFUtcElPdi1ZOElmbGJrVVBTUlBJdGVXQWhBd3RvWW5MdlZ2cmxGbnNGb3JXdDNvT05UTGRRUFNtaGtvYWdPdWVZOUR3Q2VXcQ?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-24T11:07:50Z"}, {"name": "CNBC Technology", "url": "https://www.cnbc.com/2026/11/24/nvidia-stock-jensen-huang-return.html", "date": "2026-11-24T09:49:11Z"}, {"name": "QuotedData", "url": "https://news.google.?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-24T09:44:15Z"}]}, {"text": "Governance experts disagree. One says bringing Huang back was a 'terrible mistake'. Another says Nvidia and its board may face long scrutiny.", "label": "opinion", "sources": [{"name": "Bloomberg Television", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=TELDnrsqoCU", "date": "2026-11-23T23:30:23Z"}]}, {"text": "Asian AI stocks rallied. Nikkei rose 2,208 points, and TSMC, Samsung and SK Hynix gained as Huang returned.", "label": "reported", "sources": [{"name": "News On Japan", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiVEFVX3lxTE9FVkdnZUpvdllfVnc4UGZjbjJGN0ZXb0JiUkFVcTR4MXlfNlZiZGY3QU01d3V2T3FDeWhhZTEyaHJBUmtRWXl6YVNFZi15ZzRsenVSSw?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-24T08:53:59Z"}, {"name": "Yahoo Finance", "url": "https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilwFBVV95cUxQNmJpMWN6bWFhcTZPODltRi14YUU3OGtyV0w5QURTOTYxRzUydUJxeXRrckVEOFRQaHYzaHNFVVFBN3dEX2lHakJ2d1hseVdLeThBdm1HWlJjS3B0NjBFZ2tlVDNMTHpCSm5VUTk4TjYtMEMzb3BlV2owcjh6cXBicG1iUTZmbUl3X2RaUlBSWEZxOW9vRHlZ?oc=5", "date": "2026-11-24T07:00:00Z"}, {"name": "Global Banking & Finance Review", "url": "https://news.google.com/rs